---
// S3 Multipart Upload 3-Stage Standard Protocol Sequence Diagram Component
---

<figure class="s3seq-diag" aria-labelledby="s3seq-diag-caption">
  <!-- Desktop SVG Layout -->
  <svg
    class="s3seq-diag__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 860 380"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="s3seq-diag-title s3seq-diag-desc"
  >
    <title id="s3seq-diag-title">
      S3 大檔案分段上傳（Multipart Upload）三階段標準協議時序
    </title>
    <desc id="s3seq-diag-desc">
      展示客戶端 Client 與 Amazon S3 物件儲存之間：1. Initiate 獲取 UploadId、2.
      多線程並行 PUT 分段並返回各 Part ETag、3. Complete
      提交已排序分段清單並觸發零拷貝中繼資料合併瞬間上線。
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="s3seq-arrow-blue"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="s3seq-diag__arrow-head--blue"
        ></path>
      </marker>
      <marker
        id="s3seq-arrow-green"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="s3seq-diag__arrow-head--green"
        ></path>
      </marker>
      <marker
        id="s3seq-arrow-purple"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="s3seq-diag__arrow-head--purple"
        ></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Background Framing Card -->
    <rect
      x="25"
      y="20"
      width="810"
      height="340"
      rx="12"
      class="s3seq-diag__card-bg"></rect>

    <!-- Lifeline Headers -->
    <!-- Client Node -->
    <g transform="translate(60, 38)">
      <rect
        width="200"
        height="42"
        rx="8"
        class="s3seq-diag__lane-node s3seq-diag__lane-node--blue"></rect>
      <text
        x="100"
        y="26"
        class="s3seq-diag__node-title s3seq-diag__node-title--blue"
        text-anchor="middle">Client (客戶端 SDK)</text
      >
    </g>

    <!-- S3 Storage Node -->
    <g transform="translate(600, 38)">
      <rect
        width="200"
        height="42"
        rx="8"
        class="s3seq-diag__lane-node s3seq-diag__lane-node--green"></rect>
      <text
        x="100"
        y="26"
        class="s3seq-diag__node-title s3seq-diag__node-title--green"
        text-anchor="middle">Amazon S3 儲存叢集</text
      >
    </g>

    <!-- Vertical Lifeline Dashes -->
    <line x1="160" y1="80" x2="160" y2="335" class="s3seq-diag__lifeline"
    ></line>
    <line x1="700" y1="80" x2="700" y2="335" class="s3seq-diag__lifeline"
    ></line>

    <!-- Phase 1: Initiate (y: 115) -->
    <g class="s3seq-diag__step">
      <path
        d="M 160 115 L 690 115"
        class="s3seq-diag__msg-line s3seq-diag__msg-line--blue"
        marker-end="url(#s3seq-arrow-blue)"></path>
      <rect
        x="240"
        y="98"
        width="380"
        height="26"
        rx="4"
        class="s3seq-diag__msg-pill s3seq-diag__msg-pill--blue"></rect>
      <text
        x="430"
        y="115"
        class="s3seq-diag__msg-text s3seq-diag__msg-text--blue"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        1. POST /bucket/large.iso?uploads ➔ 獲取 UploadId
      </text>
    </g>

    <!-- Phase 2: Parallel Upload Parts (y: 155, 195) -->
    <!-- Part 1 -->
    <g class="s3seq-diag__step">
      <path
        d="M 160 155 L 690 155"
        class="s3seq-diag__msg-line s3seq-diag__msg-line--green"
        marker-end="url(#s3seq-arrow-green)"></path>
      <rect
        x="220"
        y="138"
        width="420"
        height="26"
        rx="4"
        class="s3seq-diag__msg-pill s3seq-diag__msg-pill--green"></rect>
      <text
        x="430"
        y="155"
        class="s3seq-diag__msg-text s3seq-diag__msg-text--green"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        2a. PUT Part 1 (64MB) [並行 Worker 1] ➔ 回傳 ETag_1 ("b10a...")
      </text>
    </g>

    <!-- Part 2 -->
    <g class="s3seq-diag__step">
      <path
        d="M 160 195 L 690 195"
        class="s3seq-diag__msg-line s3seq-diag__msg-line--green"
        marker-end="url(#s3seq-arrow-green)"></path>
      <rect
        x="220"
        y="178"
        width="420"
        height="26"
        rx="4"
        class="s3seq-diag__msg-pill s3seq-diag__msg-pill--green"></rect>
      <text
        x="430"
        y="195"
        class="s3seq-diag__msg-text s3seq-diag__msg-text--green"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        2b. PUT Part 2 (64MB) [並行 Worker 2] ➔ 回傳 ETag_2 ("1b2c...")
      </text>
    </g>

    <!-- Phase 3: Complete Multipart (y: 240) -->
    <g class="s3seq-diag__step">
      <path
        d="M 160 240 L 690 240"
        class="s3seq-diag__msg-line s3seq-diag__msg-line--purple"
        marker-end="url(#s3seq-arrow-purple)"></path>
      <rect
        x="210"
        y="223"
        width="440"
        height="26"
        rx="4"
        class="s3seq-diag__msg-pill s3seq-diag__msg-pill--purple"></rect>
      <text
        x="430"
        y="240"
        class="s3seq-diag__msg-text s3seq-diag__msg-text--purple"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        3. POST /bucket/large.iso?uploadId=xxx (提交有序 Part &amp; ETag 清單)
      </text>
    </g>

    <!-- Phase 3 Result Banner (y: 278) -->
    <g transform="translate(160, 278)">
      <rect width="540" height="42" rx="8" class="s3seq-diag__final-pill"
      ></rect>
      <text x="270" y="26" class="s3seq-diag__final-text" text-anchor="middle">
        ✅ 200 OK ── S3 內部零拷貝中繼資料指針合併，最終物件瞬間發布上線！
      </text>
    </g>
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile View (Vertical Process Cards) -->
  <div class="s3seq-diag__mobile">
    <div class="s3seq-mobile-card s3seq-mobile-card--blue">
      <span class="s3seq-mobile-badge s3seq-mobile-badge--blue"
        >STAGE 1: INITIATE</span
      >
      <h4>1. 初始化上傳會話</h4>
      <p>• 客戶端呼叫 <code>POST /bucket/file?uploads</code>。</p>
      <p>
        • S3 返回全域唯一 <code>UploadId</code
        >，客戶端將其持久化至本地（IndexedDB/SQLite），作為斷點續傳的 Session
        錨點。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="s3seq-mobile-arrow">↓ 並行 Worker 池傳輸</div>

    <div class="s3seq-mobile-card s3seq-mobile-card--green">
      <span class="s3seq-mobile-badge s3seq-mobile-badge--green"
        >STAGE 2: UPLOAD PARTS</span
      >
      <h4>2. 多執行緒並行分段上傳</h4>
      <p>
        • 檔案切割為多個 Part（例如每塊 64MB），多線程同時發送 <code
          >PUT Part N</code
        >。
      </p>
      <p>• S3 持久化分片後返回 <code>ETag</code> 雜湊簽名。</p>
      <p>
        • <strong>斷點續傳關鍵：</strong
        >任何單一分片失敗僅重試該分片，其餘成功分片完全不受影響！
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="s3seq-mobile-arrow">↓ 收集全部 ETag</div>

    <div class="s3seq-mobile-card s3seq-mobile-card--purple">
      <span class="s3seq-mobile-badge s3seq-mobile-badge--purple"
        >STAGE 3: COMPLETE</span
      >
      <h4>3. 完成合併發布</h4>
      <p>• 客戶端提交依照 PartNumber 嚴格升序排序的清單。</p>
      <p>• 呼叫 <code>CompleteMultipartUpload</code> 請求。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="s3seq-mobile-card s3seq-mobile-card--final">
      <span class="s3seq-mobile-badge s3seq-mobile-badge--green"
        >ZERO-COPY SUCCESS</span
      >
      <h4>✅ 零拷貝中繼資料指針組裝</h4>
      <p>
        S3
        不做繁重的物理硬碟搬移，僅在分散式中繼資料庫建立指針樹，毫秒級瞬間發布完整
        Object！
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="s3seq-diag-caption" class="s3seq-diag__caption">
    圖二：S3 分段上傳三階段標準協議（Initiate、Upload Part、Complete）時序流程
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .s3seq-diag {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .s3seq-diag__desktop {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    background: var(--dg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--dg-rule);
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
  }

  .s3seq-diag__mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  .s3seq-diag__caption {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--dg-muted);
  }

  /* SVG Base Styling */
  .s3seq-diag__card-bg {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .s3seq-diag__lane-node {
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .s3seq-diag__lane-node--blue {
    fill: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.08);
    stroke: #3b82f6;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .s3seq-diag__lane-node--blue {
    fill: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.16);
    stroke: #60a5fa;
  }

  .s3seq-diag__lane-node--green {
    fill: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.08);
    stroke: #16a34a;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .s3seq-diag__lane-node--green {
    fill: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.16);
    stroke: #4ade80;
  }

  .s3seq-diag__node-title {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .s3seq-diag__node-title--blue {
    fill: #1d4ed8;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .s3seq-diag__node-title--blue {
    fill: #93c5fd;
  }

  .s3seq-diag__node-title--green {
    fill: #15803d;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .s3seq-diag__node-title--green {
    fill: #86efac;
  }

  .s3seq-diag__lifeline {
    stroke: var(--dg-rule-strong);
    stroke-width: 2;
    stroke-dasharray: 6 4;
  }

  /* Message Lines & Pills */
  .s3seq-diag__msg-line {
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  .s3seq-diag__msg-line--blue {
    stroke: #3b82f6;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .s3seq-diag__msg-line--blue {
    stroke: #60a5fa;
  }

  .s3seq-diag__msg-line--green {
    stroke: #16a34a;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .s3seq-diag__msg-line--green {
    stroke: #4ade80;
  }

  .s3seq-diag__msg-line--purple {
    stroke: #8b5cf6;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .s3seq-diag__msg-line--purple {
    stroke: #a78bfa;
  }

  .s3seq-diag__arrow-head--blue {
    fill: #3b82f6;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .s3seq-diag__arrow-head--blue {
    fill: #60a5fa;
  }

  .s3seq-diag__arrow-head--green {
    fill: #16a34a;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .s3seq-diag__arrow-head--green {
    fill: #4ade80;
  }

  .s3seq-diag__arrow-head--purple {
    fill: #8b5cf6;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .s3seq-diag__arrow-head--purple {
    fill: #a78bfa;
  }

  .s3seq-diag__msg-pill {
    fill: var(--dg-surface);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }

  .s3seq-diag__msg-pill--blue {
    stroke: #3b82f6;
  }
  .s3seq-diag__msg-pill--green {
    stroke: #16a34a;
  }
  .s3seq-diag__msg-pill--purple {
    stroke: #8b5cf6;
  }

  .s3seq-diag__msg-text {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .s3seq-diag__msg-text--blue {
    fill: #1d4ed8;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .s3seq-diag__msg-text--blue {
    fill: #93c5fd;
  }

  .s3seq-diag__msg-text--green {
    fill: #15803d;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .s3seq-diag__msg-text--green {
    fill: #86efac;
  }

  .s3seq-diag__msg-text--purple {
    fill: #6d28d9;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .s3seq-diag__msg-text--purple {
    fill: #c4b5fd;
  }

  .s3seq-diag__final-pill {
    fill: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.08);
    stroke: #16a34a;
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .s3seq-diag__final-pill {
    fill: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.16);
    stroke: #4ade80;
  }

  .s3seq-diag__final-text {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: #15803d;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .s3seq-diag__final-text {
    fill: #86efac;
  }

  /* Responsive Mobile Styling */
  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .s3seq-diag__desktop {
      display: none !important;
    }

    .s3seq-diag__mobile {
      display: flex !important;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.875rem;
    }

    .s3seq-mobile-card {
      background: var(--dg-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--dg-rule);
      border-radius: 0.75rem;
      padding: 1rem 1.125rem;
    }

    .s3seq-mobile-card--blue {
      border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6;
    }

    .s3seq-mobile-card--green {
      border-left: 4px solid #16a34a;
    }

    .s3seq-mobile-card--purple {
      border-left: 4px solid #8b5cf6;
    }

    .s3seq-mobile-card--final {
      background: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.06);
      border: 1px solid #16a34a;
      border-left: 4px solid #16a34a;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .s3seq-mobile-card--final {
      background: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.14);
      border-color: #4ade80;
    }

    .s3seq-mobile-badge {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
      font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    }

    .s3seq-mobile-badge--blue {
      color: #2563eb;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .s3seq-mobile-badge--blue {
      color: #93c5fd;
    }

    .s3seq-mobile-badge--green {
      color: #16a34a;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .s3seq-mobile-badge--green {
      color: #86efac;
    }

    .s3seq-mobile-badge--purple {
      color: #8b5cf6;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .s3seq-mobile-badge--purple {
      color: #c4b5fd;
    }

    .s3seq-mobile-card h4 {
      margin: 0 0 0.375rem 0;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-ink);
    }

    .s3seq-mobile-card p {
      margin: 0.2rem 0;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: var(--dg-ink-2);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .s3seq-mobile-card code {
      font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      background: var(--dg-surface-2);
      padding: 0.1rem 0.3rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }

    .s3seq-mobile-arrow {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--dg-muted);
      padding: 0.125rem 0;
    }
  }
</style>
